        {
          "text": "Man dong’ dhanu, gi julam, man Julawi, ku jukur dhugola, man juwer, ku Junethini, man dhanu ceke m’ukoiri gigi ni kodhidhanu mi ng’om pi cik pa Mungu, ku mon migi, man wotgi, ku nyiggi, kubang’gi ceke ma gibedo ku ng’eyong’ec ku ng’io i lembe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
