              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi kwen m’anyutha, man mi lam mi mogo ma thiri thiri, man mi lam m’awang’a ma thiri thiri, mi ceng’ sabatu, mi ceng’ mi dwi ma por, mir agba ma juketho, man mi gin ma leng’, man mi lam mi dubo kara jutim adunya pir Israel, man mi tic ceke mi ot pa Mungu mwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
