              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E wagoyo gagi, julam ku Julawi man dhanu, pi girathiera mi yen, kara jukele i ot pa Mungu mwa, calku udi pa wegwa, i nindo ma juketho, ku ba rundi ku ba rundi, kara juwang’e wi pemblam pa Yehova Mungu mwa, calu egore i cik; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.34",
